+ T^{\mu\nu} u_\mu u_\nu
\]

with:
\begin{itemize}
    \item \( \rho \) mass density,
    \item \( \bm{E}, \bm{B} \) electromagnetic field components,
    \item \( T^{\mu\nu} \) stress‑energy tensor,
    \item \( u^\mu \) local four‑velocity.
\end{itemize}

\section{Curvature Redistribution Sweep}

When the veto condition is violated, SPEHS‑v1.0 applies a redistribution sweep:

\[
