\Delta R = \alpha \left( E_{\mathrm{eff}} - E_{\mathrm{crit}} \right)
\]

where:
\[
E_{\mathrm{crit}} = \frac{c^4}{2G} R
\]

and \( \alpha \) is a simulation‑tuned coefficient ensuring stability.

